{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30650","headline":"送僧归新罗 · 姚鹄","name":"送僧归新罗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淼淼万余里，扁舟发落晖。\n沧溟何岁别，白首此时归。\n寒暑途中变，人烟岭外稀。\n惊天巨鳌鬬，蔽日大鹏飞。\n雪入行砂屦，云生坐石衣。\n汉风深习得，休恨本心违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30650.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30650","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}